    "category": "54-Inch Deck, Two 16.0Ah + Four 6.0Ah 80V (~4.5 kWh)",
    "badge": "Best Battery Capacity",
    "amazonUrl": "#",
    "pros": [
      "About 4.5 kWh nominal, the largest pack set on this list",
      "Rated by Greenworks for up to 4 acres per charge",
