          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. The 5 Best, Ranked</a>
          <a href="#battery-math" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Ah, Volts and kWh</a>
          <a href="#acreage" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Real Acreage per Charge</a>
          <a href="#charging" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Charge Time</a>
          <a href="#deck-size" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Deck Size</a>
